					"branch", f.feature, "entry", "renamed",
				}, nil)
			}
			if commandErr == nil || !strings.Contains(commandErr.Error(), "removing worktree") {
				t.Fatalf("%s did not surface locked-worktree removal failure: %v", operation, commandErr)
			}
